---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy - crossO | AKHOAI Solutions">
  <main class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-16">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 mb-8">Privacy Policy for crossO</h1>
    
    <div class="prose prose-gray max-w-none">
      <p class="text-gray-600 mb-6">Last updated: November 27, 2026</p>
      
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-8 mb-4">1. Introduction</h2>
      <p>At AKHOAI, we are committed to protecting your privacy. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, and disclose information when you use our crossO game.</p>
      
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-8 mb-4">2. Information We Collect</h2>
      <p>We do not collect any personal identifiable information (PII) from our players. The crossO game operates locally on your device.</p>
      
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-8 mb-4">3. Data Usage</h2>
      <p>Any game progress or preferences are stored locally on your device and are not transmitted to our servers.</p>
      
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-8 mb-4">4. Third-Party Services</h2>
      <p>We do not share any data with third-party service providers. However, please be aware that the App Store and Google Play store may collect certain data according to their own privacy policies.</p>
      
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-8 mb-4">5. Contact Us</h2>
      <p>If you have any questions or concerns about this Privacy Policy, please contact us at support@akhoai.com.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12">
      <a href="/" class="text-amber-500 font-bold hover:underline">&larr; Back to Home</a>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
